#. module: l10n_sk_edi_einvoice
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_edi_einvoice/models/account_move_send.py:0
msgid ""
"Complete these contacts before sending the Slovak e-invoice (%(partners)s): "
"each needs its street, city and ZIP, its tax identification number (DIC, 10 "
"digits) and, when it has one, a VAT number made of SK and 10 digits."
msgstr ""
"Pred odoslaním slovenskej e-faktúry doplňte tieto kontakty (%(partners)s): "
"každý potrebuje ulicu, mesto a PSČ, daňové identifikačné číslo (DIČ, 10 "
"číslic) a, ak ho má, IČ DPH v tvare SK a 10 číslic."

