#. module: l10n_sk_edi_einvoice
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_edi_einvoice/models/account_edi_xml_ubl_bis3.py:0
msgid ""
"The VAT number (IC DPH) '%(vat)s' of %(partner)s is not valid: it is made of"
" the prefix SK followed by 10 digits."
msgstr ""
"IČ DPH „%(vat)s“ partnera %(partner)s nie je platné: tvorí ho predpona SK a "
"10 číslic."

#. module: l10n_sk_edi_einvoice
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_edi_einvoice/models/account_edi_xml_ubl_bis3.py:0
msgid ""
"The address of %(partner)s is incomplete (%(fields)s). The Slovak VAT Act "
"requires the full address of the supplier and of the customer on the "
"invoice."
msgstr ""
"Adresa partnera %(partner)s je neúplná (%(fields)s). Zákon o DPH vyžaduje na"
" faktúre úplnú adresu dodávateľa aj odberateľa."

#. module: l10n_sk_edi_einvoice
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_edi_einvoice/models/account_edi_xml_ubl_bis3.py:0
msgid ""
"The credit note does not refer to the invoice it corrects. Create it with "
"the Credit Note button of the original invoice, or reconcile it with that "
"invoice before sending it."
msgstr ""
"Dobropis sa neodkazuje na faktúru, ktorú opravuje. Vytvorte ho tlačidlom "
"Dobropis na pôvodnej faktúre alebo ho s ňou pred odoslaním spárujte."

#. module: l10n_sk_edi_einvoice
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_edi_einvoice/models/account_move_send.py:0
msgid ""
"The invoice date is not today. A Slovak e-invoice must state the day it is "
"sent as its issue date: send it on the invoice date, or reset the invoice to"
" draft and change its date first."
msgstr ""
"Dátum faktúry nie je dnešný. Slovenská elektronická faktúra musí ako dátum "
"vyhotovenia uvádzať deň, keď sa odosiela: odošlite ju v deň uvedený na "
"faktúre, alebo ju najprv vráťte do návrhu a zmeňte dátum."

#. module: l10n_sk_edi_einvoice
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_sk_edi_einvoice/models/account_edi_xml_ubl_bis3.py:0
msgid ""
"The invoice uses the reverse charge but %(partner)s has no VAT number (IC "
"DPH). The domestic reverse charge only applies when the customer is "
"registered for VAT."
msgstr ""
"Faktúra používa prenesenie daňovej povinnosti, ale %(partner)s nemá IČ DPH. "
"Tuzemské prenesenie daňovej povinnosti sa uplatní len vtedy, keď je "
"odberateľ platiteľom DPH."

